    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dreamlike Love with Seira</strong></i> is a light visual novel, featuring renowned illustrator rubisama as the director and original artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel presents a single linear story, with text dialogue, manga-style illustrations, 2D character art, and voice acting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not include branching storylines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764Hope you could experience the sweet service and warm dreams with Seira within the brief durations\u2764</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning, Artist:Rubi-sama (\u308b\u3073\u69d8)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario: Orisuke (\u30aa\u30ea\u30b9\u30b1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986260/extras/8407b7aa92542d743b5dbe6c7ca85121.avif?t=1730705557\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story about Sweet Dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Haruto Watari, finishes a stressful day of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He goes back home, exhausted, to a cluttered room that only makes him all the more fatigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But unable to find the drive or will to clean up, he collapses into bed and falls asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, he has an unbelievable dream... A dream where he's the owner of a luxurious Western mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in that dream mansion, he meets a maid named Seira.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maid whose duty is to serve him, her master\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be it brewing a delicious cup of black tea or comforting him with kind swords, she heals his tired soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dream of sweet, passionate service is about to begin...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986260/extras/c671ee40fd7e91ccb2aeb844b56e98a1.avif?t=1730705557\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Maid Providing Perfect Service</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2615\ufe0f Seira \u2615\ufe0f</strong> <strong><i>Voice Actress: Hana Kagehotaru</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986260/extras/a7258740e759b32a7887e4cd52f9f41e.avif?t=1730705557\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss Seira, the maid who appears in Haruto's dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With proper etiquette and versatile domestic skills, she excels at brewing exquisite black tea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She patiently listens to Haruto's work-related complaints, embodying a truly perfect woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot; Please don't hesitate. After all, you are the owner of this mansion.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986260/extras/38338fc2afdace0f0b41b75bbd148c09.avif?t=1730705557\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p>",
